From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP player loader skips cut holes (null-chunk NPE)

After corridor gap register, Moonrise still tries to send/generate the hole.
Neighbors look ready, FULL chunk is null, region tick dies. Skip unpinned cut
keys in the player loader and null-check the send path. Post-applyAllPatches.
---

--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/player/RegionizedPlayerChunkLoader.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/player/RegionizedPlayerChunkLoader.java
@@ -534,6 +534,11 @@
